as if there were 12 chips per **linear inch**. But the problem says there are 12 chips per **square inch**. So the number of chips needed depends on the mosaic’s area:

\[
\text{chips needed} = 12 \times (\text{height} \times \text{length})
\]

The original code incorrectly did:

```python
